{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"层意象"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"层意象"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>层意象是"},{"Local":{"url":"景","text":"景"}},{"Plain":"上的"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":"构成的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":", 也即由"},{"Local":{"url":"景","text":"景"}},{"Plain":"所"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>几何对象 (如拓扑空间, 代数簇, 概形) 上的层意象可视为几何对象在意象范畴中的化身.</p>\n<p>层意象的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的内语言","text":"内语言"}},{"Plain":"具有"},{"Local":{"url":"层语义","text":"层语义"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}